	(text "Bridge rectifier made of four Schottky diodes: the board works with straight and\ncrossed RJ12 cables. Note: board GND sits one diode drop below bus GND\n(no problem for RS-485, common-mode range -7..12 V).\n200 mA resettable fuse: the bridge draws about 20..40 mA from the 24 V bus."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 110.49 0)
