	(text "Solder jumpers A select / B select: default 1-2 (A = RJ12 pin 4, B = pin 3).\nMeasure J1 pin 5 (+) against pin 1 (-): +24 V -> keep 1-2, -24 V -> both to 2-3.\nIdle bias 4k7/4k7 (A high, B low). Leave the 120R termination open,\nclose it only if communication is unreliable. SM712 + 10R per TI datasheet (9.2.2).\n~RE and ~SHDN high -> auto direction via D. While transmitting, R is high-Z\nand the 10k pull-up keeps RS485_RX high (no echo)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 214.63 195.58 0)
		(effects
